      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This week, PRADA unveiled its Fall/Winter 2026 men's bag collection, designed once again by co-creative directors Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons. Crafted from distressed leather, the classic briefcases, totes, and clutches boast a supple texture that naturally develops realistic creases. Dark contrasting stitching traces the silhouettes, while dense, meticulous seams infuse each piece with a nostalgic, artisanal charm.",
